
oratcl will build and run with the cygwin environment.
standard commands to build cygwin.

> ../configure --prefix=TCL_INSTALLED_DIRECTORY --enable-stubs --with_oracle_directory=$ORACLE_HOME
> make
> make install

to use oratcl after installing, use the package require command of Tcl/Tk.

% package require Oratcl

or

% package require -exact Oratcl 3.1
